# generated kernel tarballs (multi-GB); regenerate with
# board/nn/beagley-ai/mk-kernel-tarball.sh
dl/
# TI vendor firmware — copied from the board / bbb.io-cc33xx-1.0.2.10-firmware,
# not ours to redistribute
board/*/*/fw/*.bin
# TI vision-apps RTOS firmware (j722s-*-fw, ~24 MB) staged by build-image.sh
# from the vendor artifact store.  These carry NO extension, so the rule above
# does not cover them -- ignore the whole staging directory rather than trust
# a pattern to keep vendor blobs out of a public remote.
board/*/*/fw/ti/
